&8 \cos \frac{11 \pi}{6} + 8 \cos 0 + 8 \cos \frac{\pi}{6} + 8 \cos \frac{\pi}{3} + 8 \cos \frac{\pi}{2} + 8 \cos \frac{2 \pi}{3} \\
